.TH BOB-DER 1 "September 2026" "bob-der @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bob-der \- autonomous Ollama coding agent for the terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bob-der
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ task ... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bob-der
runs an interactive terminal coding agent. The primary model is
nemotron-3-super:cloud, the only subagent is gpt-oss:20b-cloud, and
gemma4:31b-cloud supplies vision capabilities.
.PP
Without a task, bob-der opens its interactive Textual interface. With a task,
it performs a one-shot autonomous run.
.PP
On a newly configured computer, run
.B bob-der-setup
once to install Ollama, sign in, and prepare the required cloud models. Run
.B bob-der-setup --check
to inspect the local Ollama setup without changing it.
.PP
The prompt accepts multiline pasted text. Press Enter to insert a newline and
Ctrl+Enter to submit. Shift+Enter and Ctrl+S are alternate submit shortcuts.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-C ", " \-\-directory " " PATH
Use PATH as the working directory.
.TP
.BR \-\-plan
Inspect with read-only tools and return an implementation plan.
.TP
.BR \-\-deep
Reason, plan, revise, execute, and verify without a reasoning-step limit.
.TP
.BR \-\-max-steps " " N
Set the autonomous step ceiling; zero disables the ceiling.
.TP
.BR \-\-model-timeout " " SECONDS
Set the model timeout; zero disables the timeout.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Show reasoning summaries and tool output.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Print only the final response.
.TP
.BR \-\-check-update
Check GitHub Releases for a newer version.
.TP
.BR \-\-update
Download a newer Ubuntu package and verify its SHA-256 checksum.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show command-line help.
.SH INTERACTIVE COMMANDS
.TP
.B /plan
Toggle read-only plan mode.
.TP
.B /deep
Toggle deep reasoning mode.
.TP
.B /copy
Copy the latest answer.
.TP
.B /update
Download and verify a newer Ubuntu package from GitHub Releases.
.TP
.B /help
Show all interactive commands.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.bob-der/sessions/
Saved conversation sessions.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ollama (1),
.BR bwrap (1)
